{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.poster.avif?t=1759263154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.webm?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.mp4?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farmfence</strong> is a strategic survival game where peaceful farming by day turns into desperate defense by night. Grow crops, manage resources, and build your homestead\u2014then brace yourself as waves of undead swarm your fields after sunset. Can you harvest enough to survive the horrors of the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/e3106adf12fffd3be3812dfbf29a5b27.poster.avif?t=1759263154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/e3106adf12fffd3be3812dfbf29a5b27.webm?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/e3106adf12fffd3be3812dfbf29a5b27.mp4?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending farming simulation with tower defense mechanics, <i>Farmfence</i> challenges players to balance productivity and protection in a dynamic day-night cycle. Customize your farm layout, upgrade your defenses, and unlock new tools to withstand increasingly aggressive zombie raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/51532eddf0b077ec058a56351e646bd1.poster.avif?t=1759263154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/51532eddf0b077ec058a56351e646bd1.webm?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/51532eddf0b077ec058a56351e646bd1.mp4?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual builder or a tactical survivor, <i>Farmfence</i> offers a unique twist on the farming genre with fast-paced combat, strategic planning, and satisfying progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1e <strong>Day-Night Gameplay Loop</strong>: Farm by day, defend by night\u2014each cycle brings new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Crop Management</strong>: Plant, grow, and harvest a variety of crops to fuel your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Zombie Defense</strong>: Build fences, turrets, and traps to protect your farm from nightly invasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Base Building</strong>: Design your farm layout for both efficiency and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade System</strong>: Unlock new tools, structures, and abilities as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Balance resource allocation between farming and fortification.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/b6d67a2a68d9c6b360948c4268f2be63.poster.avif?t=1759263154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/b6d67a2a68d9c6b360948c4268f2be63.webm?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/b6d67a2a68d9c6b360948c4268f2be63.mp4?t=1759263154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Demo :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day &amp; Night Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant , Farm and Sell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend farm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013790?t=1759263154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013790?t=1759263154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/2b5940121e4e3445d62b705d8c1be20756eea638/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759263154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/2b5940121e4e3445d62b705d8c1be20756eea638/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759263154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013790/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.poster.av